      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027ve moved `UsesNonDefaultSwizzle` to backend as suggested but since I\u0027m now checking `TextureViewDescriptor` is a `TextureComponentSwizzleDescriptor`, some CTS tests are now failing. See https://i.imgur.com/8dKpzIi.png\n\nI believe it\u0027s because Blink only passes the swizzle descriptor to Dawn if swizzle is non-default, but it\u0027s not checking for depth-stencil. See https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/blink/renderer/modules/webgpu/gpu_texture.cc;l\u003d106;drc\u003d945be0ea5f086965baa5ff3bcf43d49781347cb1\n\nDo you see where how to solve this properly in the backend?",
